# Simon looks

Do not visually test this app. Simon stands in front of the kiosk.

- No Cursor browser, no screenshots, no click-through, no "I verified the card looks like…".
- Deploy and reload only when `kiosk-ui-both-hubs` says the **kiosk** will show the change. Then stop.
- Use the kiosk skill only when Simon reports a bug or asks you to debug a device. Not after a UI change.
